Subject: [PATCH] net: phy: mxl-gpy: register the MxL862xx hwmon chip info

MTK's 999-ephy-gpy211-add-mxl862xx-integrated-phy.patch assigns
mxl862xx_hwmon_chip_info to 'info' in gpy_hwmon_register() and then
registers gpy_hwmon_chip_info. Pass 'info'.

--- a/drivers/net/phy/mxl-gpy.c
+++ b/drivers/net/phy/mxl-gpy.c
@@ -251,7 +251,7 @@ static int gpy_hwmon_register(struct phy

 	hwmon_dev = devm_hwmon_device_register_with_info(dev, hwmon_name,
 							 phydev,
-							 &gpy_hwmon_chip_info,
+							 info,
 							 NULL);

 	return PTR_ERR_OR_ZERO(hwmon_dev);
